{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925280/extras/Tlatoani-Progress-GIF-S.gif?t=1734686881\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925280/extras/Header_Rise_and_Become_Tlatoani.png?t=1734686881\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the wonders of the Aztec Civilization as you build your own magnificent metropolis in this ancient city builder combining the sweep and grandeur of the classic Impressions Games with the intimate citizen simulation and freeform planning of Banished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is an Open Alpha of Tlatoani</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925280/extras/Header_Prologue_Features.png?t=1734686881\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>3 Tutorial missions</strong> - learn the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>3 Scenario missions</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Random Map Generator</strong> - Generate maps to play on</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Auto Service Walkers</strong> - Service range based buildings with auto routing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Individual Citizen AI</strong> - All citizens are simulated</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Disasters</strong> - Fire, Floods, Wind Damage, Trade Caravan Theft. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>God and Festival Management</strong> - Dedicated system to manage Gods. Set up festivals, offer goods and sacrifices to gain Gods favor and blessings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Military System V1</strong> - Enable &quot;full military&quot; in game settings to play with first iteration of the military system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>God/Sandbox Mode</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Day/Night Cycle</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925280/extras/Header_Roadmap.png?t=1734686881\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is a work in progress so there is still a lot to do:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finish UI polish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finish proper rework of the military system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finish and polish people animations and look/feel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add monument buildings to the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finish the historical missions </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finalize sound effects</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925280/extras/Header_Join_Discord.png?t=1734686881\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help us make this a better game and join our Discord to provide us with feedback, report bugs or crashes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">---<strong> Join our Discord</strong> (Link available on Steam page right side menu) ---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925280/extras/Header_Wishlist.png?t=1734686881\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you like what we have so far, be sure to add it to your Wishlist</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925280/extras/TL_Thank_You_Banner.png?t=1734686881\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2925280?t=1734686881","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925280/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1734686881","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925280/787525119daf48cdb04b00dabc61d1a9e130bcbb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1734686881","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925280/787525119daf48cdb04b00dabc61d1a9e130bcbb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1734686881","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925280/extras/Tlatoani-Progress-GIF-S.gif?t=1734686881\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925280/extras/Header_Rise_and_Become_Tlatoani.png?t=1734686881\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the wonders of the Aztec Civilization as you build your own magnificent metropolis in this ancient city builder combining the sweep and grandeur of the classic Impressions Games with the intimate citizen simulation and freeform planning of Banished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is an Open Alpha of Tlatoani</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925280/extras/Header_Prologue_Features.png?t=1734686881\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>3 Tutorial missions</strong> - learn the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>3 Scenario missions</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Random Map Generator</strong> - Generate maps to play on</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Auto Service Walkers</strong> - Service range based buildings with auto routing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Individual Citizen AI</strong> - All citizens are simulated</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Disasters</strong> - Fire, Floods, Wind Damage, Trade Caravan Theft. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>God and Festival Management</strong> - Dedicated system to manage Gods. Set up festivals, offer goods and sacrifices to gain Gods favor and blessings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Military System V1</strong> - Enable &quot;full military&quot; in game settings to play with first iteration of the military system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>God/Sandbox Mode</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Day/Night Cycle</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925280/extras/Header_Roadmap.png?t=1734686881\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is a work in progress so there is still a lot to do:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finish UI polish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finish proper rework of the military system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finish and polish people animations and look/feel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add monument buildings to the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finish the historical missions </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finalize sound effects</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925280/extras/Header_Join_Discord.png?t=1734686881\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help us make this a better game and join our Discord to provide us with feedback, report bugs or crashes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">---<strong> Join our Discord</strong> (Link available on Steam page right side menu) ---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925280/extras/Header_Wishlist.png?t=1734686881\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you like what we have so far, be sure to add it to your Wishlist</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925280/extras/TL_Thank_You_Banner.png?t=1734686881\" /></p>","developers":["Perspective Games","Bellwood Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3161270","name":"Tlatoani: Aztec Cities"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925280/header.jpg?t=1734686881","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2024 Paradox Interactive AB. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257018651,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257018651/movie480.mp4?t=1714066238","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257018651/movie_max.mp4?t=1714066238"},"name":"Tlatoani Game Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257018651/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1714066238","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257018651/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1714066238","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257018651/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1714066238"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257015928,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257015928/movie480.mp4?t=1713130429","max":"http://v